***REMOVED***"## Example 2: Grounding ChatGPT with data retrieved from a kNN search query using an Elasticsearch machine learning model for embeddings\n",
***REMOVED***"\n",
***REMOVED***"The next example will show how to chat with your data using a vector search query using embeddings produced by a model deployed to your Elasticsearch cluster.  This example is adapted from the Elastic Search Labs guide [\"How to deploy NLP: Text Embeddings and Vector Search\"](https://www.elastic.co/search-labs/how-to-deploy-nlp-text-embeddings-and-vector-search), and uses the same dataset that we already downloaded in the previous example.\n",
***REMOVED***"\n",
***REMOVED***"First, we will need to install the `eland` package, which we will use to deploy an embedding model."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "02fdf05d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"!pip install eland[pytorch]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8d6c7581",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"Next, we will deploy the model `msmarco-MiniLM-L-12-v3` model from Hugging Face, which is trained on a superset of the data we have already indexed in the previous example."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "7b31d2e9",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"!eland_import_hub_model \\\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***--url {elasticsearch_endpoint}:443 \\\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***--es-api-key {elasticsearch_api_key} \\\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***--hub-model-id sentence-transformers/msmarco-MiniLM-L-12-v3 \\\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***--task-type text_embedding \\\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***--start"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "570de4ea",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"Next, we can reindex our data with the embeddings from the model to enable kNN search using those embeddings.  In the next cell, we'll create an ingest pipeline to calculate embeddings from the data."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "49109c76",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"from elasticsearch.client import IngestClient\n",
***REMOVED***"\n",
***REMOVED***"pipeline_id = \"msmarco-minilm-l-12-v3\"\n",
***REMOVED***"ingest_processors = [\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***{\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***  \"inference\": {\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"model_id\": \"sentence-transformers__msmarco-minilm-l-12-v3\",\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"target_field\": \"text_embedding\",\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"field_map\": {\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***  \"text\": \"text_field\"\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\n",
***REMOVED***"  ***REMOVED***\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\n",
***REMOVED***"]\n",
***REMOVED***"\n",
***REMOVED***"on_failure = [\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***{\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***  \"set\": {\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"description\": \"Index document to 'failed-<index>'\",\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"field\": \"_index\",\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"value\": \"failed-{{{_index}}}\"\n",
***REMOVED***"  ***REMOVED***\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***{\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***  \"set\": {\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"description\": \"Set error message\",\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"field\": \"ingest.failure\",\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"value\": \"{{_ingest.on_failure_message}}}\"\n",
***REMOVED***"  ***REMOVED***\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\n",
***REMOVED***"]\n",
***REMOVED***"\n",
***REMOVED***"ingest_client = IngestClient(elastic_client)\n",
***REMOVED***"\n",
***REMOVED***"ingest_client.put_pipeline(\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***id=pipeline_id,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***on_failure=on_failure,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***processors=ingest_processors\n",
***REMOVED***")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "63da95e8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"Then, we'll reindex the `msmarco-passagetest2019-unique` index using the pipeline we just created."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "140fc17d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"# Create the new index\n",
***REMOVED***"elasticsearch_embeddings_index_name = f\"msmarco-passagetest2019-unique-{pipeline_id}\"\n",
***REMOVED***"mapping_properties = {\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"text_embedding.predicted_value\": {\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"type\": \"dense_vector\",\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"dims\": 384,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"index\": True,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"similarity\": \"cosine\"\n",
***REMOVED***"  ***REMOVED***,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***  \"text\": {\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"type\": \"text\"\n",
***REMOVED***"  ***REMOVED***\n",
***REMOVED***"}\n",
***REMOVED***"\n",
***REMOVED***"create_index(\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***elastic_client,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***elasticsearch_embeddings_index_name,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED*****mapping_properties)\n",
***REMOVED***"\n",
***REMOVED***"# Reindex source data into target index\n",
***REMOVED***"reindex_source = {\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"index\": elasticsearch_index_name\n",
***REMOVED***"}\n",
***REMOVED***"reindex_dest = {\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"index\": elasticsearch_embeddings_index_name,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"pipeline\": pipeline_id\n",
***REMOVED***"}\n",
***REMOVED***"\n",
***REMOVED***"response = elastic_client.reindex(\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***source=reindex_source,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***dest=reindex_dest,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***wait_for_completion=False\n",
***REMOVED***")\n",
***REMOVED***"print(response)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fe3900f7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"The reindexing operation may take some time, so we can poll for the task status before moving to the next step."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "1c5bf795",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"from time import sleep\n",
***REMOVED***"\n",
***REMOVED***"is_completed = False\n",
***REMOVED***"while not is_completed:\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***sleep(1)\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***task = elastic_client.tasks.get(task_id=response.get(\"task\"))\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***is_completed = task.get(\"completed\")\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\n",
***REMOVED***"print(\"Reindexing is complete!\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "648d6e4a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"Now that we have our embeddings index ready to go, we can use this new index with embeddings with the Azure OpenAI On Your Data service.  Note that this call to `chat_with_my_data` passes in some configuration for our embeddings."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "818e393c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"chat_query = \"What's the weather like in Jamaica?\"\n",
***REMOVED***"\n",
***REMOVED***"chat_with_my_data(\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***chat_query,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***chat_model_deployment_name,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***elasticsearch_endpoint,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***elasticsearch_api_key,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***elasticsearch_embeddings_index_name,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***elasticsearch_embedding_model=\"sentence-transformers__msmarco-minilm-l-12-v3\"\n",
***REMOVED***")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2125fbee",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"## Example 3: Grounding ChatGPT with data retrieved from a kNN search query using Azure OpenAI embeddings\n",
***REMOVED***"\n",
***REMOVED***"We also have the option to create embeddings to use for kNN search using Azure OpenAI.  \n",
***REMOVED***"\n",
***REMOVED***"For this example, in addition to the chat model deployment used in the previous two examples for chatting with your data, you will also need an embedding model deployment added to your Azure OpenAI resource.  We will first use this embedding model to generate embeddings on your data, and then later refer to this deployment in our requests to the Azure OpenAI On Your Data service, which will call the model to generate the embeddings for your query as a part of the chat request.\n",
***REMOVED***"\n",
***REMOVED***"First, we will create a new index with the correct mappings for embeddings produced using the Azure OpenAI Ada embedding model."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "5df5e380",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"aoai_embeddings_index_name = f\"msmarco-passagetest2019-unique-{embedding_model_deployment_name}\"\n",
***REMOVED***"mapping_properties = {\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"id\": {\"type\": \"keyword\"},\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"text\": {\"type\": \"text\"},\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"text_embedding.aoai_predicted_value\": {\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"type\": \"dense_vector\",\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"dims\": 1536,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"index\": True,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\"similarity\": \"cosine\"\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***\n",
***REMOVED***"}\n",
***REMOVED***"\n",
***REMOVED***"create_index(\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***elastic_client,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***aoai_embeddings_index_name,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED*****mapping_properties\n",
***REMOVED***")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7882d2ac",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"Next, we will calculate embeddings for our dataset.  Note that this step may take some time."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "9091deb6",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"dataframe = datasets.get_dataframe_with_aoai_embeddings(\"msmarco\", embedding_model_deployment_name)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "44b2b5e2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"Then, we will index the data with embeddings we just calculated."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "9767db99",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"index_data(\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***elastic_client,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***dataframe,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***aoai_embeddings_index_name,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***add_aoai_embeddings=True,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***aoai_embedding_model_deployment=embedding_model_deployment_name\n",
***REMOVED***")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c505efc9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"Now that our index has been created with Azure Open AI embeddings, we can use the new index to chat with our data."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "eea9580a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
***REMOVED***"chat_query = \"What's the weather like in Jamaica?\"\n",
***REMOVED***"chat_with_my_data(\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***chat_query,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***chat_model_deployment_name,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***elasticsearch_endpoint,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***elasticsearch_api_key,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***aoai_embeddings_index_name,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***aoai_embedding_model=embedding_model_deployment_name,\n",
***REMOVED***"***REMOVED***aoai_embedding_key=openai.api_key\n",
***REMOVED***")"
   ]
  }
